'''Baron Seal''' (ヒュージゴマ ''Hyūji Goma,'' '''Huge Goma''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] variant of [[Sir Seal]] unique to the [[Baron Seal Strikes]] event. He was added in [[Version 9.3 Update|Version 9.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Baron Seal
|image = E 499.png
|money drop = 2,500¢ - 9,875¢
|appearance = [[Baron Seal Strikes]]
}}

==Enemy==
Baron Seal, despite its slow speed, rapidly attacks from a surprisingly high 320 range. Its [[Freeze]] and [[Weaken]] are rendered moot by its raw strength and support that receive skyrocketing magnifications in later stages, enough to fully invalidate traditional tanking with many melee units being unable to close the distance.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Baron Seal Strikes/Red Alert 1~20]].''

