==Trivia==
*The word ''Goma'' in his Japanese name, Huge Goma, means "sesame", but it also references the spotted seal's Japanese name, that being ''gomafuazarashi'', The first two syllables being ''goma'' references the sesame-like spots on their backs, which can also be seen on Baron Seal.
*According to [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]'s Japanese description, [[B.B.Bunny]] was set to become the first [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] [[:Category:Colossus Enemies|Colossus]] but switched places with [[Sir Seal]] partway through, leading to an incomplete J.J. Jackrabbit and the creation of Baron Seal.
*He is one of the six enemies that were updated to have the Colossus type in [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]], the others being [[Le'Grim]], [[Mega-Mooth]], [[Super Hyppoh]], [[Archangel Exiel]] and [[Big Peng Z]].

